<title>UK: CRH sets 1.0 bln FFR fungible June 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>CRH sets 1.0 bln FFR fungible June 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE DE REFINANCEMENT HYPOTHECAIRE (CRH)</p>
<p> AMT  * 1.0  BLN	COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    06.JUN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  105.66    PAY DATE    28.JUL.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    104.31    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 3.45 BLN FFR BOND</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE GOV LAW     FRENCH</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED OATS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
